Paul de Weerd <paul@mail.me.maar.nu> wrote:

> Can anyone recommend an audiocard for a PWS-600au ?

In my FreeBSD alpha I have an ISA sound card, but OpenBSD doesn't
support ISA DMA.  In fact, you PWS should have on-board ISA audio,
but it's unusable for that reason.

I'm afraid that despite Miod's admonitions most of us who have added
audio to an alpha have an eap(4) card.  Looking at our list of
supported audio, I get the impression that there's a dearth of PCI
cards.

